    "paletteSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/moritzmhmk/vscode-monokai-light/master/themes/monokai-light-color-theme.json",
    "notes": "Based on the community VS Code theme: white paper, dark foreground, gray selection, red accent and green, cyan, purple, orange and yellow syntax colors. The source defines only paper, foreground and selection for the UI; neutral surface steps and semantic roles are adapted for Typie. Orange, yellow and green inks are darkened for contrast. Missing editor hues interpolate the source anchors in OKLCH; all 17 meet 4.5:1 on paper. Highlights mix source colors over paper."
  },
